CONTRIBUTING

Ephemeris is intentionally small and command-line first.  Contributions should
preserve that shape.


DEVELOPMENT

        make
        make test

The test target runs a deterministic end-to-end fixture through the real
ephemeris binary.


STYLE

        Keep commands inspectable.
        Prefer SQLite tables over hidden in-memory state.
        Prefer plain text inputs and tab-separated outputs.
        Keep point-in-time semantics explicit.
        Add model parameters as files, not hardcoded constants.
        Do not add alpha features before auditability exists.


PATCHES

Each patch should include:

        the command or data surface it changes
        the database tables it reads or writes
        the validation command used

Run make test before pushing.


DATA

Do not commit proprietary market data, SEC cache dumps, generated databases,
or model outputs derived from restricted data.
